<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Friday it had cut its rating for Clear Channel Communications Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 42-5/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
